24	+    # found), this is inverted: DENY vector codegen by default for every
25	+    # generic/dispatch file (no computational reason for any of them to
26	+    # need a specific ELEN), and explicitly ALLOW-LIST only the files
27	+    # confirmed (by their own genuine, hand-written __riscv_v* intrinsic
28	+    # kernels -- not guessed) to need full v: vec.cpp and repack.cpp, and
