30	+    # split -- hand-written RVV quantization kernels). Everything else in
31	+    # GGML_CPU_SOURCES is generic op dispatch/graph bookkeeping with no own
32	+    # RVV code, so constraining it is free and closes off the whole bug
33	+    # class within those files, not just the two instances found here.
